  "description": "3.0 x 1.8 m deck module, origin at the module centre on the deck top. Owns the post pair at its landward end (x = -1.5), posts protruding 0.42/0.34 m as mooring posts and reaching 1.65 m below the deck; its seaward stringer ends rest on the next module's landward headstock. Three materials: WeatheredTimber, WetTimber (below y = -0.5), RustyIron. 1,912 triangles.",
  "brief": "Crescent Cove (Holodeck tropical-island) jetty deck module per the kit sheet and the approved eye-level view: low, weathered, silver-brown timber deck on round posts, planks across with visible gaps, bolts and nail heads, stringers on twin headstocks, X-braced post pair, algae-stained timber below the splash line. Chains with itself and the platform along the jetty line.",
